Structured bindings as the for-range-declaration (N5008
[stmt.ranged]/1, [dcl.struct.bind]) over an iterator range, by value
and by reference; the reference form must write through to the
original range object (`auto &&__range` binds by reference).
Reduced from a SEGV on CBMC's own remove_cpp_exceptions.cpp
(round-129 dog-food).
